flowchart TD
    ClientReq["Client Request Received\n(Endpoint, Path UUID, Bearer JWT)"] --> CheckJWT{"Valid JWT & Non-Expired?"}
    
    CheckJWT -->|No| Deny401["Return HTTP 401 Unauthorized\n(Terminate & Log Audit Event)"]
    CheckJWT -->|Yes| ExtractUID["Extract Verified auth.uid() & Role"]
    
    ExtractUID --> CheckRBAC{"Route Accessible by Role?\n(anon, authenticated, admin)"}
    CheckRBAC -->|No| Deny403["Return HTTP 403 Forbidden\n(Permission Denied)"]
    
    CheckRBAC -->|Yes| CheckTargetResource{"Is Resource User-Owned?\n(e.g., /analysis/{id})"}
    
    CheckTargetResource -->|No: Shared Public/Static| AllowExecution["Execute Endpoint Logic"]
    CheckTargetResource -->|Yes: User Sensitive Asset| QueryOwnership["Query Resource Metadata in Database"]
    
    QueryOwnership --> EvaluateOwner{"resource.user_id == auth.uid()?"}
    EvaluateOwner -->|No: Attempted IDOR| DenyIDOR["Return HTTP 404 Not Found\n(Mask Existence to Prevent Enumeration)"]
    EvaluateOwner -->|Yes: Verified Owner| AllowExecution
    
    AllowExecution --> RLSGate["PostgreSQL RLS Execution Gate\n(Enforce WHERE user_id = auth.uid())"]
    RLSGate --> SuccessReturn["Return HTTP 200 OK\n(Only Requested User's Records)"]
